{"speciesId":742,"names":{"fr":"Bombydou","es":"Cutiefly","en":"Cutiefly","ja":"アブリー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il se nourrit du nectar et du pollen des fleurs. Ayant la capacité de percevoir l’aura des choses, il sait quelles fleurs vont bientôt éclore."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se alimenta de néctar y polen. Es capaz de detectar los capullos que están a punto de abrirse."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It feeds on the nectar and pollen of flowers. Because it’s able to sense auras, it can identify which flowers are about to bloom."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"花のミツや 花粉が 餌。 オーラを 感じる 力を 持ち 咲きそうな 花を 見分けている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ils volettent gaiement en nombre au-dessus de la tête de certaines personnes dont l’aura s’apparenterait à celle d’une fleur."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Revolotean en bandadas en torno a la cabeza de aquellas personas que cuentan con un aura similar a la de las flores."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Myriads of Cutiefly flutter above the heads of people who have auras resembling those of flowers."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"花に 似た オーラを 持つ 人の 頭の 上には たくさんの アブリーが 集まってくるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il aime le nectar et le pollen, et se dispute ces denrées avec Papilusion dans les champs de fleurs."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Le encanta el néctar y el polen. Revolotea en busca de alimento por campos de flores, donde tiene sus rifirrafes con Butterfree."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Nectar and pollen are its favorite fare. In fields of flowers, it gets into skirmishes with Butterfree over food."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"花のミツと 花粉が 好物。 花畑で エサを 巡り バタフリーと 小競り合いをしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il perçoit l’aura des êtres vivants, ce qui lui permet de se jouer de son adversaire en prévoyant et en anticipant ses mouvements."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Percibe el aura de los seres vivos. Aprovecha esta capacidad para juguetear con el enemigo anticipándose a sus movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cutiefly can pick up the auras of living things. It skillfully reads those auras to predict its foes’ movements and make fools of them."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"生き物の オーラを 感じ取る。 オーラから 動きを 先読み して 敵を 翻弄 するのが 得意。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon raffole du pollen et du nectar. Il volette souvent près des Tournicoton pour collecter leur pollen."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Le fascinan el néctar y el polen. Suele revolotear alrededor de los Gossifleur, atraído por su polen."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Nectar and pollen are its favorite fare. You can find Cutiefly hovering around Gossifleur, trying to get some of Gossifleur’s pollen."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"花粉や 蜜が 大好物。 ヒメンカの 花粉を 狙って アブリーが 近くを 飛びまわる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il perçoit l’aura de son ennemi et anticipe ses mouvements. Il parvient ainsi à éviter les attaques et à riposter dans la foulée."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Al percibir el aura del rival, puede predecir sus movimientos y esquivarlos sin problema mientras lanza su contraataque."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"An opponent’s aura can tell Cutiefly what that opponent’s next move will be. Then Cutiefly can glide around the attack and strike back."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"敵が 発する オーラから つぎの 行動を 予測する。 攻撃を ひらりと かわして 反撃する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":742,"moves":[{"name":"absorb","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"stun-spore","learns":[[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[17,"machi